cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "ICMR-AMRSN Trend Tracker"
message: "If you use this software or dataset, please cite it, and also cite the underlying ICMR AMRSN annual reports."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Yashita
    family-names: Thakur
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-7895-5250"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yashita-thakur/icmr-amrsn-trend-tracker"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, reproducible pipeline that extracts national antimicrobial
  susceptibility trend tables from the Indian Council of Medical Research (ICMR)
  Antimicrobial Resistance Surveillance Network (AMRSN) annual reports and
  publishes them as structured, fully provenance-annotated data. Every extracted
  value carries the source report year and table number, enabling detection of
  cross-report revisions of the same underlying year.
keywords:
  - antimicrobial resistance
  - AMR
  - surveillance
  - India
  - ICMR
  - AMRSN
  - open data
  - reproducible research
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-25"
